e company's own management reporting.","case_for_exclusion":"If these costs relate to a permanent shift in logistics strategy or a new contract's delivery requirements, they may be recurring."}],"deductions":[{"item":"Deferred Maintenance - ERP & Racking","category":"deferred_maintenance","amount":15000,"recurrence":"recurring","year":2024,"justification":"Operational expert flags aging ERP (NBV 33% of cost) and Warehouse Racking (NBV 37.5% of cost) requiring replacement in 12-24 months. An annualised provision for this 'capex cliff' is required.","confidence":"high","defensibility_score":8,"case_for_inclusion":"The buyer will inherit an immediate capital requirement to maintain current operational throughput due to aged infrastructure.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller may argue that existing depreciation charges already account for the wearing out of these assets."},{"item":"Productivity Correction (Payroll Normalisation)","category":"redundant_cost","amount":45000,"recurrence":"recurring","year":2024,"justification":"Payroll as % of revenue has doubled from 11% (2020) to 21% (2024). This indicates significant inefficiency or over-hiring. A deduction is applied to reflect the cost of returning to a sustainable productivity level.","confidence":"medium","defensibility_score":5,"case_for_inclusion":"The current staff cost structure is unsustainable and significantly higher than the historical baseline that generated similar margins.","case_for_exclusion":"The seller will argue this is not a 'deduction' but a 'synergy' for the buyer to find, and that current staffing is necessary for modern compliance/operations."}],"total_add_backs":180000,"total_deductions":60000,"adjusted_ebitda":{"conservative":229360,"base":364360,"optimistic":424360},"adjustment_summary":{"reported_ebitda":244360,"plus_add_backs":180000,"minus_deductions":60000,"equals_adjusted_ebitda_base":364360},"director_salary_analysis":{"directors":[{"name":"Management Team (2)","current_salary":90000,"es