ting margins have expanded from 17.6% to 21.8%, demonstrating positive operational gearing.","The company has successfully deleveraged, moving from a 25.2% gearing ratio in 2020 to 0% in 2024.","Cash reserves have grown by 330% since 2020, reaching over £1.05m by March 2024.","Earnings quality is high, with net profit consistently tracking operating performance and no exceptional items noted.","Staff costs are the primary overhead, but revenue per head has improved as the team scaled from 12 to 22 employees."],"red_flags":["Moderate customer concentration with the top 3 debtors representing 35.6% of the sales ledger."],"narrative":"Team Test Co presents an exceptionally strong financial profile for acquisition. The company has demonstrated remarkably consistent organic growth, maintaining a 15% revenue CAGR while simultaneously expanding its operating margins. This indicates that the business is not just growing its top line, but is becoming more efficient as it scales—a hallmark of a high-quality IT services provider. The stability of the 85% gross margin suggests a highly standardised service delivery model with significant pricing power in the IT and Telecoms sector. From an earnings quality perspective, the performance is 'clean'; profits are driven by core operations rather than one-off items, and the effective tax rate remains predictable. The balance sheet is a particular highlight; the transition to a zero-debt position while accumulating over £1m in cash reserves provides the buyer with a 'fortress' balance sheet. This liquidity, combined with an interest coverage ratio of 288x, suggests the business could comfortably service significant acquisition debt if required. The only minor note for caution is the customer concentration in the sales ledger, though the blue-chip nature of the debtors (e.g., Blackstone, M&G) mitigates much of the credit risk. Overall, the financial data reflects a disciplined, highly profitable, and cash-generative business with no visible signs of cost pressure or decelerating momentum."}}	{"balanceSheet":{"id":183,"financialPeriodId":222,"targetCompanyId":45,"intangibleAssets":"295600","tangibleFixedAssets":"248900","freeholdProperty":null,"leaseholdProperty":null,"plantMachinery":null,"fixturesFittings":null,"motorVehicles":null,"computerEquipment":null,"stockInventory":null,"tradeDebtors":"378450","prepayments":null,"amountsOwedByDirectors":null,"amountsOwedByConnectedCompanies":null,"directorsCurrentAccount":null,"otherDebtors":null,"cashAtBank":"1189680","totalCurrentAssets":"1568130","tradeCreditors":null,"taxationSocialSecurity":null,"vatPayable":null,"corporationTaxDue":null,"bankLoansOverdraftCurrent":null,"hirePurchaseCurrent":null,"accruals":null,"amountsOwedToDirectors":null,"otherCreditors":"342580","totalCurrentLiabilities":"342580","bankLoansLongTerm":null,"hirePurchaseLongTerm":null,"deferredTaxation":null,"otherLongTermDebt":"0","totalLongTermLiabilities":"0","shareCapital":"100","retainedEarnings":"1769950","totalEquity":"1770050","debtorsList":null,"creditorsList":null,"fixedAssetsDetail":null,"sourceDocumentId":234,"createdAt":"2026-03-27T11:57:36.229Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-27T11:57:36.229Z"},"fixedAssets":{"id":15,"targetCompanyId":45,"reportDate":"2024-01-31","totalGrossBookValue":"472300","totalAccumulatedDepreciation":"217612","totalNetBookValue":"254688","propertyGrossValue":"0","propertyNetBookValue":"0","plantMachineryGrossValue":"0","plantMachineryNetBookValue":"0","vehiclesGrossValue":"24800","vehiclesNetBookValue":"18600","itEquipmentGrossValue":"140400","itEquipmentNetBookValue":"60093","otherAssetsGrossValue":"307100","otherAssetsNetBookValue":"175995","refinanceableAssetsValue":"18600","fullyDepreciatedStillInUse":"0","assetItems":[{"description":"AI Platform License","category":"Software","purchase_date":"2021-02-03","cost":156000,"accumulated_depreciation":78000,"net_book_value":78000,"depreciation_rate":20,"depreciation_method":"Straight-line","location":null