n challenge is the massive gap between revenue-based expectations (common in e-commerce) and earnings-based reality (common in low-margin retail). Furthermore, the £682k in 'Other Creditors' must be cleared or converted to equity for the business to be viable for acquisition. The recommended equity value range of £150k-£340k assumes a debt-free/cash-free transaction where intercompany balances are settled prior to close."}	\N	65	medium	9911	{"promptTokenCount":8309,"candidatesTokenCount":1611,"totalTokenCount":9920}	55	{financial,qoe,sector,risk,operational}	2026-04-26 13:05:08.632542	2026-04-26 13:06:39.941
