y of the assets and the growth trajectory. The final equity value is bolstered by a healthy cash balance, but a buyer should implement a working capital peg to prevent further aggressive dividend extraction prior to completion. The primary deal risk is the gap between the seller's likely £1M+ expectation and the fair market value of ~£735k."}	\N	72	high	8720	{"promptTokenCount":9034,"candidatesTokenCount":1630,"totalTokenCount":10664}	59	{financial,qoe,sector,risk,operational}	2026-04-25 10:56:20.500143	2026-04-25 10:57:03.826
