gory":"Amortisation","value":75502,"percent_of_overheads":13.32},{"category":"Staff Wages & Salaries","value":50106,"percent_of_overheads":8.84},{"category":"Professional Fees","value":41969,"percent_of_overheads":7.41}],"cost_base_classification":"mixed"},"earnings_quality":{"net_profit_tracks_operating_profit":false,"exceptional_items_identified":["Government Grant income of £100,000 in 2024","Government Grant income of £30,000 in 2023"],"tax_rate_consistent":false,"ebitda_latest":44947,"ebitda_trend":"growing","limitations":["Full P&L data unavailable for 2022 and 2021 due to small company filing exemptions","Depreciation and Amortisation split inconsistently in early years"]},"debt_service":{"latest_interest_coverage":-1.51,"interest_coverage_trend":"improving","additional_debt_capacity_assessment":"Extremely limited. The company is currently unable to cover existing interest obligations from operating cash flow and relies on director funding."},"key_findings":["Revenue grew by 19.3% in 2024, primarily driven by an 80% surge in the Agriculture sector.","The company is technically insolvent with a net liability position of £664,927 as of August 2024.","Operating losses narrowed significantly in 2024, but this was heavily supported by a £100k one-off government grant.","Gross margins are healthy and improving (40.3%), suggesting the core product is viable if overheads can be scaled.","Liquidity is critical; the current ratio of 0.45 indicates a severe inability to meet short-term obligations without external support.","Heavy reliance on director financing, with over £850k owed to directors in long-term debt.","Intangible assets (regulatory dossiers) comprise the majority of the asset base, carrying significant valuation risk.","Staff and director costs represent over 40% of revenue, indicating a high human-capital cost base."],"red_flags":["Technical insolvency with widening net liabilities (£664k deficit).","Critical liquidity position with a current ratio of 0.4