lue and the EBITDA-derived Enterprise Value suggests that the business is currently being valued close to its liquidation floor plus a small goodwill component. A buyer should be wary of the 'capex cliff' resulting from years of under-investment in the asset base. Negotiation will likely be difficult as the seller may still be anchored to the superior financial performance seen in 2020."}	\N	62	medium	10134	{"promptTokenCount":8458,"candidatesTokenCount":1634,"totalTokenCount":10092}	1	{financial,qoe,sector,risk,operational}	2026-03-27 11:41:44.821183	2026-03-27 11:42:30.613
