ive_summary":"DNA presents a 'Proceed with Caution' opportunity. The business is financially stable, underpinned by a robust balance sheet with 2.4m in net assets and a healthy cash position of nearly 0.5m. It has demonstrated an ability to generate consistent profits and service its debt comfortably. However, the screening identifies three primary risks: a recent 9.2% revenue decline in 2026, a lack of data regarding customer concentration (a critical risk in Telecoms/Facilities sectors), and high owner dependency evidenced by director remuneration exceeding 220,000. The deal is attractive for its asset backing and historical profitability, but the trajectory of the Panels division and the sustainability of the Telecoms contracts must be verified. Further investigation should focus on the sales ledger and the impact of removing the current directors from the cost base."}	\N	\N	\N	10260	{"promptTokenCount":14769,"candidatesTokenCount":1503,"totalTokenCount":16272}	11	{data_quality}	2026-04-15 07:47:14.80388	2026-04-15 07:47:25.109
