ility in directors' pension contributions suggests that 'owner-managed' expenses could be normalised to reveal higher underlying EBITDA. In summary, DNA is a financially stable, low-risk target from a solvency perspective, but one that currently faces operational headwinds and margin compression that must be addressed to justify a premium valuation."}	\N	72	high	13493	{"promptTokenCount":20942,"candidatesTokenCount":2500,"totalTokenCount":23442}	11	\N	2026-04-15 07:47:32.25443	2026-04-15 07:47:46.227
