olutions represents a high-conviction 'Proceed' opportunity. The company has demonstrated remarkable financial discipline, maintaining a flat 85% gross margin while scaling revenue from 1.25m to 2.18m over five years. Profitability is not just 'on paper'; the company has converted earnings into a 1.05m cash pile and eliminated all long-term debt. The balance sheet is fortress-like with a current ratio of 4.6. While there is some concentration in the sales ledger (top 5 clients at 51%), the debtors are high-quality institutional names like Aberdeen Standard and Blackstone, and aged debt is virtually non-existent. The team structure is balanced, with low director-dependency and a strong focus on R&D. This is a lean, profitable, and rapidly growing business that warrants immediate progression to full due diligence."}	\N	\N	\N	11284	{"promptTokenCount":39549,"candidatesTokenCount":1538,"totalTokenCount":41087}	1	{data_quality}	2026-04-16 18:19:36.163023	2026-04-16 18:19:47.492
